Update: ESMFold2-pipeline is now available on AriaxBio. It enables designing nanobodies, scFvs, and miniproteins using structural templates, hotspot targeting, and Protenix v2 validation.

@aaronmring has been impressed with ESMFold2's design capabilities. To support local use and features like structural templates, multichain targets, hotspots, Protenix-v2 validation, and automated MSA handling, this project was created.

The pipeline brings Biohub's experimentally validated binder-design method to Ariax for scalable miniprotein, VHH nanobody, and scFv campaigns.
